orming challenges, with each step harder than the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/27e48ad05caa47b6d6e0dd6c03128d69.poster.avif?t=1756997667\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/27e48ad05caa47b6d6e0dd6c03128d69.webm?t=1756997667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/27e48ad05caa47b6d6e0dd6c03128d69.mp4?t=1756997667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726\u00a0 \u00a0\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u00a0 \u00a0\u2726</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udde9\u00a0<strong>SOLVE\u00a0BRAIN-TEASING PUZZLES\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udde9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not every level is about speed, some will test your mind with clever trials to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/f27ef179df86b6a82c2379b2c60dbfb6.poster.avif?t=1756997667\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/f27ef179df86b6a82c2379b2c60db